contentText:
Ciara Miller might have found her perfect first dance song ahead of her Dancing With the Stars stint, thanks to Sabrina Carpenter fans.

In an interview with Entertainment Tonight posted Wednesday (Sept. 2), the reality star reacted to audience members requesting that she and pro partner Brandon Armstrong break it down to &#8220;Taste&#8221; for their first televised performance on the competition. &#8220;Oh my gosh!&#8221; Miller gasped. &#8220;That is so funny. That is amazing.&#8221;

